OL,3,AKing describes slave trade as 'shameful
OL,4,Achapter' that 'fills my heart with
OL,5,Ahorror' in Commonwealth speech
OL,6,
OL,7,FKing Charles III is opening the
OL,8,FCommonwealth Heads of Government
OL,9,FMeeting (Chogm) in Antigua and Barbuda
OL,10,F- you can watch live above
OL,12,FIn his speech to leaders, he addresses
OL,13,Fthe slave trade and says the "shameful
OL,14,Fchapter of history is one that fills my
OL,15,Fheart with horror"
OL,17,FThese are some of the most powerful
OL,18,Fwords the King has ever said on the
OL,19,Fslave trade and he addressed the issue
OL,20,Fearly in the speech, our senior royal
OL,21,Fcorrespondent writes
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
